       "url": "statement",
       "valueString": "/*\n@internal: Number of Malaria Primary Series doses\n*/\ndefine \"Number of Malaria Primary Series Doses Administered\":\n  Count(\"Malaria Primary Series Doses Administered to Patient\")"
