       "url": "statement",
       "valueString": "/*\n@dataElement Live attenuated vaccines\n*/\ndefine \"Live Attenuated Vaccines\":\n  Elements.\"Live Attenuated Vaccines\" I\n    where I.occurrence.toInterval() same day or before Today"
