       "url": "statement",
       "valueString": "/*\n@internal: Polio Dose 0 Doses Administered to Patient\n*/\ndefine \"Polio Dose 0 Doses Administered to Patient\":\n  PolioElements.\"Polio Dose 0 Doses Administered to Patient\".onOrBefore(Today)"
