      {
       "url": "name",
       "valueString": "Primary series is complete. Client is not due for typhoid booster dose Guidance"
      },
      {
       "url": "statement",
       "valueString": "/*\n@output: Primary series is complete. Client is not due for typhoid booster dose Guidance\n@guidance: Should not vaccinate client with typhoid booster dose as the latest typhoid dose was administered less than 3 years ago.\nCheck for any other vaccines due and inform the caregiver of when to come back for the next dose.\n*/\ndefine \"Primary series is complete. Client is not due for typhoid booster dose Guidance\":\n  'Should not vaccinate client with typhoid booster dose as the latest typhoid dose was administered less than 3 years ago.\nCheck for any other vaccines due and inform the caregiver of when to come back for the next dose.'"
